 Median : 5.8897   Median :3.281e+00  
 Mean   : 6.5041   Mean   :3.809e+00  
 3rd Qu.: 8.8487   3rd Qu.:5.617e+00  
 Max.   :13.8799   Max.   :1.209e+01  
